Recommends: percona-python%!{PYFT_MINOR}t-pytest
Description: Concurrent database testing tool
 StormWeaver is a concurrent database testing tool: a C++23 core (metadata,
 actions, workers, SQL) driven from free-threaded Python scenarios. It
 starts its own PostgreSQL or MySQL servers from an installation directory
 given with -i, so no server package is required. Runs on
 /opt/percona-python%!{PYFT_MINOR}t.
